      "math_structure": {
        "type": "sl2z_generator_decomposition",
        "template": "B=\\prod L(m_i)R(k_i)",
        "variable_count": 4
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "分解",
          "steps": [
            "$L(-1)B=\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\1&2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1\\\\1&2\\end{pmatrix}$",
            "同原题方法，$\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1\\\\1&2\\end{pmatrix}=S\\cdot L(2)=R(1)L(-1)R(1)L(2)$",
            "故 $B=L(1)R(1)L(-1)R(1)L(2)$，代入验证可得 $B$"
