    {
      "text": "证明 $\\det\\begin{pmatrix}1&m\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}=1$ 且 $\\det\\begin{pmatrix}1&0\\\\k&1\\end{pmatrix}=1$ 对任意整数 $m,k$ 成立，并说明这为何是这些矩阵能表示 $SL(2,\\mathbb{Z})$ 中元素的必要条件。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "行列式",
        "SL(2,Z)"
      ],
      "question_type": "证明题",
      "method": [
        "直接计算行列式"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "计算两类矩阵行列式",
        "说明乘积行列式性质"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "determinant_of_generators",
        "template": "\\det L(m)=\\det R(k)=1",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 4,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "证明",
          "steps": [
            "$\\det\\begin{pmatrix}1&m\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}=1\\cdot1-m\\cdot0=1$",
            "$\\det\\begin{pmatrix}1&0\\\\k&1\\end{pmatrix}=1\\cdot1-0\\cdot k=1$",
            "由行列式乘积性质，任何这类矩阵之积的行列式恒为1，故只能表示 $\\det=1$ 的矩阵，即 $A\\in SL(2,\\mathbb{Z})$ 是必要条件（本题 $\\det A=4-3=1$ 满足）"
          ]
        }
      ],
